TEXT 1080 320 Left 2 ;Computed impedance
TEXT 1080 336 Left 2 ;Computed magn. voltage peak value
TEXT 728 368 Left 2 ;actual magn. voltage
TEXT 1080 352 Left 2 ;Computed relative permeability
TEXT 1064 368 Left 2 ;Computed magn. flux density peak value
TEXT 1064 384 Left 2 ;Computed magn. field strength peak value
TEXT 784 80 Left 2 ;NOTE: All variables with "x" are computed values\nHere the flux is varied from 0 to fact*phiN from 0 to 0.3s\nfact maybe 1,2 or 3\nNow "x" parameters are computed for fact*PhiN (phi123x)\nvaried through a pwl voltage source\nBest to use:\nfact=1 mytime=1s .tran 1s\nfact=2 mytime=2s .tran 2s\nfact=3 mytime=3s .tran 3s\nNow time is related to phi-values\nof course you could also use time=0.1,0.2,0.3s
TEXT 712 384 Left 2 ;Actual flux density
TEXT 712 400 Left 2 ;Actual field strength
TEXT 512 40 Left 2 ;change a,m for another B,H curve characteristic
TEXT 280 144 Left 2 !ERfe Rfe 0 value={Rfe} tripdv=1 tripdt=1\nELfe Lfe 0 value={N*N/Rfe} \n \nEphiN phin 0 value={PhiN} tripdv=1 tripdt=1\nEimuN imyn 0 value={imyn} tripdv=1 tripdt=1\n \nEarea area 0 value={area*calib_area} tripdv=1 tripdt=1\nElen length 0 value={length*calib_length} tripdv=1 tripdt=1\nEN N 0 value={N} tripdv=1 tripdt=1
TEXT 728 304 Left 2 ;actual area
TEXT 728 320 Left 2 ;actual length
TEXT 712 416 Left 2 ;Actual magnetizing current
TEXT 712 432 Left 2 ;Actual current Rfe (iron lost)
TEXT 1016 264 Left 2 ;???x-values: at simulation end at fact*PhiN
TEXT 720 336 Left 2 ;Nr. of Windings
TEXT 280 232 Left 2 !EWmagn wmagn 0 value={0.5*PhiN*imyN*(a*(i(vphi)/phiN)**2+(2*(1-a)/(m+1))*(i(vphi)/phiN)**m)} tripdv=1 tripdt=1
TEXT 872 224 Left 2 ;magn. energy
TEXT 448 408 Left 2 ;NOTE: If primary winding is delta\nthen Ife,imy are the delta winding\ncurrent which is lower than the\nstar winding current. For the\nnet current multiply by 1.73205
